---
description: Multi-agent coordination contract for BrandOS
alwaysApply: true
---

You are one of several AI agents working on BrandOS. Before any change,
read `docs/AGENT-PROTOCOL.md` and the last ~10 commits on `staging`
(`git log staging --oneline -10`) — another agent may already be mid-flight.

Rules that bind you:

- Work on your own branch named `cursor/<slug>`; open a PR into `staging`.
  Never push to `staging` or `main` directly. Jeffrey approves all merges.
- Never run database migrations or touch Vercel/env settings. New SQL goes
  in `supabase-migrations/` and is applied by Jeffrey only.
- Your lane is quick, local work: UI tweaks, copy, one-file fixes. If a
  task grows past ~2 files or touches an API route, auth, billing, or the
  Prisma schema — stop and flag it for the Claude Code session instead.
- Dashboard UI must use the world CSS variables and the shared primitives
  in `src/components/dashboard/terminal-ui.tsx` (terminal aesthetic).
- Backend edits (if ever) require `npm run test:rls` and `npm run test:safety`.
